id: ops-m82r
title: Freeze the merge-driver launcher and accept every released launcher revision
description: "Companion pm-cli-website-5p5z. Freeze a minimal runtime delegate so automatic pm-ops bumps do not require consumer edits. Export a hash-based canonical launcher assertion accepting the frozen template and every released historical revision; preserve omit-dev, broken-install, artifact and merge:install behavior. Consumers remain untouched."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-16T12:47:02.875Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-21T18:41:41.636Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T18:41:37.996Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T18:41:37.996Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "[PR #177](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/pull/177) delivers the frozen thin launcher and canonical revision assertion. The implementation exists; no further Git merge-driver work should be scheduled under the no-git contract."
resolution: "Reverified main eba7d5262fd7 (unchanged since audit): [PR #177](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/pull/177) delivers the frozen thin launcher and canonical revision assertion. The implementation exists; no further Git merge-driver work should be scheduled under the no-git contract. Retained evidence: launcher-check.ts, templates/prepare-merge-driver.ts, test/launcher-check.test.ts."
expected_result: "[PR #177](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/pull/177) delivers the frozen thin launcher and canonical revision assertion. The implementation exists; no further Git merge-driver work should be scheduled under the no-git contract."
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T12:47:16.245Z",codex-agent,"Design: companion pm-cli-website-5p5z. Keep only the unavoidable dependency-free bootstrap in the frozen template: artifact short-circuit, runtime resolution, fail-closed presence probe and child delegation. Driver behavior stays in merge-driver-prepare.ts and merge-driver.ts. Record five distinct released template hashes from all release tags through v2026.10.16, with provenance fixtures. Export assertCanonicalLauncher from pm-ops/launcher-check; reject modified, empty and unreadable launchers. Verify real clone install/ci, omit-dev and broken layouts, frozen hash and behavioural reverts. No consumer edits."
  "2026-10-16T12:50:12.870Z",codex-agent,"Proofs: focused linked suite passed 24/24, zero failures/skips/cancellations. Replaced only assertCanonicalLauncher with the previous byte-equality behavior, rebuilt dist, and ran node --test --test-name-pattern=\"every released launcher\" test/launcher-check.test.ts: failed 1/1 on a released copy. Restored the function and rebuilt. Reverted only templates/prepare-merge-driver.ts to origin/main and ran node --test --test-name-pattern=\"frozen v1\" test/launcher-check.test.ts: failed 1/1 on the recorded hash. Restored all candidate bytes. Real temp Git repos prove install/ci registers actual pm drivers, omit-dev emits exactly the existing notice and leaves drivers absent, and broken packages fail without registration. Existing probes cover local, hoisted, global, dangling, malformed and unreadable lookup paths."
  "2026-10-16T12:55:19.669Z",codex-agent,"Final bootstrap preserves metadata probing as well as physical lookup paths: simplifying it further incorrectly skipped broken package self-references. New self-reference tests failed 2/2 against the simplified probe and pass 2/2 after retaining the metadata check. Final focused suite: 26/26, zero failures/skips/cancellations. All 12 release tags with a launcher match the five historical hashes and fixtures match their provenance tags byte-for-byte. Initial full npm gate passed 1325 tests with 2 optional real-data skips and 100/100/100/100 coverage; rerunning both full gates on final bytes. No pm CLI/SDK bugs encountered; linked-test result recording is disabled by existing project policy, so receipts are recorded in comments."
  "2026-10-16T13:11:55.040Z",codex-agent,"Final receipts: npm run release:check and bun run release:check both passed under isolated HOME and Git config, each 1327 passed / 0 failed / 2 optional real-data skips (1329 total), with 100/100/100/100 coverage across 26 source files and 0% duplication at unchanged thresholds. npm run accept:packed passed for npm/Node and native Bun, including frozen/oldest/modified launcher assertions, real SDK trackers, validation, strict merge-driver health and npm 11/npm 10 pack config preservation. Final focused linked suite passed 26/26 through pm test --run --progress. Re-executed assertion and template revert proofs on final bytes: each failed its intended test 1/1 before restoration. Independent fresh-repo proof: zero drivers became all five declared pm drivers; omitted package exited 0 with exactly the existing notice and unchanged config; broken package failed loudly with unchanged config. Git core.autocrlf=true checkout preserved the template and all five archived fixtures byte-for-byte. Privacy scan passed. No consumer edits or threshold changes. Two optional configured-repository tests remain unexecuted; historical copies retain historical bootstrap behavior. No pm CLI/SDK bugs encountered. Companion pm-cli-website-5p5z; leave this Feature in progress for orchestrator verification."
